{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19596","headline":"立春日晓望三素云 · 李应","name":"立春日晓望三素云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄鸟初来日，灵仙望里分。\n冰容朝上界，玉辇拥朝云。\n碧落流轻艳，红霓间彩文。\n带烟时缥缈，向斗更氤氲。\n髣髴随风驭，迢遥出晓雰。\n兹辰三见後，希得从元君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李应","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}